220	`wrangler.toml` is intentionally minimal. Deploy and local Worker scripts
221	generate `.wrangler/wrangler.<env>.deploy.toml` from `environments.json`.
222	Generated deploy configs do not contain routes.
223	Run the route sync scripts when adding a product domain so Cloudflare maps the
224	product account hostnames to the existing regional Workers.
